            "review_title": "Review at Com Ga Tu Quynh",
            "review_text": "Lauren bloom\n3 contributions\n0\nDelicious food\nApr 2024 • Family\nTheir signature dish, the chicken rice, is a true masterpiece. Imagine succulent, melt-in-your-mouth chicken boasting a delicate sweetness. The accompanying rice is fluffy and fragrant, soaking up the delicious juices from the chicken. But the magic doesn't stop there. The flavorful broth is a revelation in itself, perfectly complementing the entire dish. Each bite is an explosion of taste and texture, leaving you wanting more.\nFor those seeking variety, CƠM GÀ offers other delectable options. Their shredded chicken rice is a delightful choice, offering a lighter yet equally satisfying experience. And for the adventurous foodie, the fried chicken with fish sauce is a must-try. The crispy exterior gives way to juicy, tender chicken, perfectly balanced by the sweet and savory fish sauce.\nWhile there seems to be some inconsistency regarding the service, the overall impression leans towards friendly and helpful staff. However, it's always good to manage expectations – a bustling restaurant might experience occasional delays.\nThe true star of the show remains the food. At a very reasonable price point, CƠM GÀ offers a delicious and satisfying meal. Whether you're a seasoned foodie or simply craving a comforting dish, CƠM GÀ is sure to leave you happy and content.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 27, 2024",
